{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方大面积、高亮度的白色文字，字号明显最大；右上角目录字较小，下方音符动画亮度较低，不构成主要视觉竞争。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"正处在两个人亲近相处的时刻，暂时不想考虑以后，只想舒服地享受当下。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、沉浸。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他其实很喜欢这种亲近，也想表达喜欢、确认对方是否有同样的感情，但没能开口；内心还有犹豫和未说出口的情绪。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字太长，一块里包含当下的舒适、对未来的回避、表达喜欢的念头和无法开口的犹豫等多层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1e9a61b9-d154-4578-bdf6-0f00cfd28556", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014631554690Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.89, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:47:01.438071+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d6aa3bc41a5eb64b8cf8042182dcbd64ef1f72e585ac97562bbd26f11a032bd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734b